B.brp=new A.aX("Muted Text Colour",B.pO,"Colour for secondary / label text such as dates, locations, and other supporting copy (8-digit hex #RRGGBBAA recommended).\n\nLeave empty to use the theme default (#FFFFFF80 \u2014 50% white).")
B.brq=new A.aX("Secondary Button Colour",B.H7,'Background colour for secondary action buttons \u2014 used infrequently for actions that are neither the main call-to-action nor a cancel/undo, such as "View all runs" or "Download GPX" (8-digit hex #RRGGBBAA recommended).\n\nLeave empty for no custom secondary button colour.')
